# Phase 7: hostile arguments to every system call are refused with the right
# error, unknown call numbers return ENOSYS, and the kernel keeps running.
lumen kernel shell
!send run /bin/badptr
!wait 4
badptr:
0 wrong
badptr: PASS: every bad argument was refused and the kernel is still running
run: /bin/badptr exited with status 0
!send run /bin/hello
!wait 2
run: /bin/hello exited with status 42
